# AI Judge — Supabase Edge Functions
# VS Code REST Client compatible (install "REST Client" extension by Huachao Mao)
# JetBrains HTTP Client compatible
#
# Setup:
#   1. Replace <YOUR_PROJECT_REF> with your Supabase project reference ID
#      (found in: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API → Project URL)
#   2. Replace <YOUR_ANON_KEY> with your Supabase anon key
#      (found in: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API → Project API keys)
#   3. Deploy functions: supabase functions deploy --no-verify-jwt

@baseUrl = https://lfxxewkqdnafrzponnvs.supabase.co/functions/v1
@anonKey = sb_publishable_IgxeXGuplIR66etTMISMgQ_O-uEQ43E

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### GET /status — Get current evaluation status
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### POST /setup-db — Create all database tables
### Safe to re-run (uses IF NOT EXISTS)
### Requires exec_sql RPC or run SQL manually
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/setup-db
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### POST /judge — Start evaluation pipeline
### Provide a public Google Sheet URL
### Returns immediately; poll /status for progress
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/judge
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sheet_url": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jqx2C8IOz2UFSN02yKBSkjS8zGs3-eNnvoxLoFZyba4/edit?usp=sharing"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### GET /results — Fetch all evaluation results
### Returns evaluations joined with BA/AI SE findings,
### category scores, and qualitative insights
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### GET /download-csv — Download results as CSV
### Streams a flat CSV file with all evaluation data
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/download-csv
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Accept: text/csv

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### POST /reset-db — Clear all data from all tables
### DESTRUCTIVE: removes all evaluations, findings,
### scores, insights, and jobs. Tables remain intact.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/reset-db
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
